# Diabetes Prediction System
A machine-learning application that returns an educational diabetes risk estimate from health parameters. Its output is not a diagnosis or a clinically validated individual risk assessment.

## Project Overview
This system analyzes health measurements such as glucose, blood pressure, BMI, insulin, age, and other indicators to estimate a model class probability.

## Key Features
- Diabetes Risk Prediction
- Context-aware AI diabetes education assistant
- Data Preprocessing and Feature Engineering
- Machine Learning Model Training and Evaluation
- Ensemble Learning Techniques
- Scalable and User-Friendly Architecture

## Technologies Used
