- Insulin
- BMI
- Diabetes Pedigree Function
- Age

## Model evaluation

The versioned Random Forest pipeline was evaluated on a reproducible 20% stratified
holdout split (`random_state=42`): 154 rows, including 100 class-0 and 54 class-1
examples. The recorded holdout metrics were:

| Metric | Score |
|----------|----------|
| Accuracy | 74.68% |
| Recall (class 1) | 57.41% |
| Precision (class 1) | 65.96% |
| F1 (class 1) | 61.39% |

Confusion matrix (rows=true class, columns=predicted class): `[[84, 16], [23, 31]]`.
These are a single small-dataset holdout result, not a validation of clinical usefulness,
calibration, or performance on other populations. The API's percentage is the classifier's
class-1 probability, not a clinically calibrated individual risk or diagnosis.

